newsboat is the RSS reader.

Navigation:
	j/k - Move down/up
	J/K - Previous/next feed
	n/N - Next/previous unread
	l/Enter - Open entry
	h/q - Back/quit
	Q - Quit immediately

Article actions:
	a - Toggle article read/unread
	A - Mark all as read

Open links:
	U - Show all URLs
	,, - Open main link with linkhandler
	,p - Pick program to open link
	,v - Open video link in mpv
	,w - Open link in w3m
	,c - Copy link to clipboard
